2-24\", \"changes\": \"Additional evaluation of (virtual) full bore sensor and additional software version.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"3\", \"date\": \"2021-08-02\", \"changes\": \"Additional evaluation for extending temperature to −25 °C and for E2 class and O class for the flow transmitter. Addition of software version.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"4\", \"date\": \"2021-08-26\", \"changes\": \"Addition of full-bore sizes up to DN1200.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"5\", \"date\": \"2021-11-23\", \"changes\": \"Addition of full-bore sizes up to DN1800.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"6\", \"date\": \"2022-05-20\", \"changes\": \"Addition of accuracy class 1 to DN1800.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"7\", \"date\": \"2022-08-30\", \"changes\": \"Software version updates due to addition of microprocessors.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"8\", \"date\": \"2023-07-03\", \"changes\": \"Software update.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"9\", \"date\": \"2023-09-23\", \"changes\": \"Addition of AquaMaster4 FEW45Y.Z Mobile comms variant of calculating and indicating device. Software update.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"10\", \"date\": \"2024-02-26\", \"changes\": \"Software update and change to U200 wireless module for global use.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"11\", \"date\": \"2025-01-27\", \"changes\": \"Software update.\"},\n    {\"revision\": \"12\", \"date\": \"2025-04-07\", \"changes\": \"Hardware update due to the addition of resistor alternatives.\"}\n  ]\n}"
